{
 "profile_id": "masilonyana",
 "profile_name": "Masilonyana Local Municipality (Theunissen, Free State)",
 "short_name": "Masilonyana",
 "_doc": "Masilonyana LM (Theunissen). Same billing vendor as Ditsobotla / uPhongolo. Two shapes: (B) tri-lingual 'TAX INVOICE / STATEMENT' with comma-decimal space-thousands money, ledger Date / Description / VAT / Debit (incl) / Credit / Balance and a meter table under each consumption line (Factor, dates, rate, units, description, reading type, Exclusive) - 8 bills, 5 of them scans read by OCR; (A) older 'TAX INVOICE' with period decimals and a Debit(Incl) column, basic charge only - 1 bill. One OCR file is page 2 of a statement only (no electricity, routes but gives no electricity row). Electricity: basic charge (per kVA), 'Electricity Consumption nKW - [start to end]', 'Electricity Demand Charge nKVA - [..]'; ex VAT = debit - VAT per line, with the meter table's Exclusive preferred. A VAT cell printed ',00' (no rand digit) is left blank (= 0) rather than misread 100x; OCR 'O' for zero in quantities leaves kWh/kVA blank. Account = payment Reference (the 'Account Number' in the bank block is the municipality's bank account). Fingerprint: own VAT number + name/domain. IDENTITY masi_ledger_ex_r = (debit - VAT) of basic + energy + demand ledger lines vs total built from the Exclusive column: 0.00 on 9/9 electricity rows (circular for the basic charge, which has no Exclusive cell; on these bills energy is mostly 0).",
 "fingerprint": {
